+config INMYS_BOARD_ID
+	tristate "INMYS board ID reader"
+	depends on OF && GPIOLIB
+	help
+	  Reads the board revision from strap GPIOs described by the
+	  board-id-gpios Device Tree property and exposes it in sysfs
+	  as the board_id attribute.
